<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal sells 90 pct of Quimigal for 8.6 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal sells 90 pct of Quimigal for 8.6 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's government said on Thursday that it had sold a 90 percent stake in state-owned chemicals group Quimigal-Quimica to Portuguese firm Quimigest for 8.6 billion escudos.</p>
<p>The sale was approved at a cabinet meeting.  </p>
<p>Quimigest-Sociedade Quimica de Prestacao de Servicos is owned 75 percent by the Mello group.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
